OL,3,AKatie Price's ex said take it to grave,
OL,4,Arape trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe former husband of Katie Price told
OL,7,Fa teenager after allegedly raping her
OL,8,Fthat she should "take it to the grave",
OL,9,Fa court has heard.
OL,11,FKieran Hayler, 39, is on trial at Lewes
OL,12,FCrown Court accused of three counts of
OL,13,Frape and one count of sexual assault in
OL,14,FWest Sussex in 2016, all of which he
OL,15,Fdenies.
OL,17,FThe complainant, who was 13 at the time
OL,18,Fof the alleged offences, wept during a
OL,19,Fpolice interview shown to jurors when
OL,20,Fshe admitted lying to her mum about
OL,21,Fwhat happened because she "didn't want
OL,22,Fher to think I was disgusting".
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
