OL,3,AKatie Price's ex said take it to grave,
OL,4,Arape trial hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "I thought it was my fault
OL,7,Ffor ages," adding that she told her mum
OL,8,FHayler had touched her but not that it
OL,9,Fwas sex as she feared that "maybe I'd
OL,10,Fled him on".
